### Findings

- `DesignSettingsScreen` is a standalone Compose view with parameters `selectedStyle`, `onStyleSelected`, and `modifier`; the only production render path found is `AppShellScreen -> LocalTabContent -> DesignSettingsScreen` for `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot`: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:48`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461`.
- Current app version data flow only passes `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` from app layer into app-shell/drawer; `VERSION_CODE` exists in app Gradle config but is not currently passed to `AppShellScreen`: `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43`, `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`.
- Preview/test surface relevant to stale call sites: `DesignSettingsScreenPreview` calls `DesignSettingsScreen`, and `AppShellScreenTest` calls `AppShellScreen` with `appVersionName = "test"`: `android/feature/local/settings/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/local/settings/presentation/ui/DesignSettingsScreen.kt:298`, `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/androidTest/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/AppShellScreenTest.kt:254`.

