### Data flow

- Current app version name: `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:17` -> generated app `BuildConfig.VERSION_NAME` -> `apps/android-next/src/main/java/com/tpov/schoolquiz/apps/android_next/MainActivity.kt:43` -> `AppShellScreen.appVersionName`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:123` -> `DrawerContent.versionName`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:220` -> `DrawerFooter.text = "v$versionName"`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerFooter.kt:74`.
- Current versionCode source exists in app Gradle config: `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:16`; app module has `buildConfig = true`: `apps/android-next/build.gradle.kts:33`.
- Settings route: drawer renders visible local sections including Settings: `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/Visibility.kt:75`, `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/Visibility.kt:80` -> drawer item calls `navigator.goTo(Destination.SelectSection(section))`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/drawer/DrawerSectionList.kt:37` -> Settings maps to `LocalConfig.SettingsRoot`: `shared/feature/app-shell/domain/src/commonMain/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/shared/feature/app_shell/domain/logic/AppShellTransitions.kt:34` -> AppShell renders `DesignSettingsScreen`: `android/feature/app-shell/presentation/src/main/kotlin/com/tpov/schoolquiz/android/feature/app_shell/presentation/ui/AppShellScreen.kt:461`.

