### Impact Scan

| Consumer | Assumption | Impact | Severity |
|---|---|---|---|
| `DesignSettingsScreenPreview` | Calls `DesignSettingsScreen` with only `selectedStyle` and `onStyleSelected` | Signature changes need preview update | Medium — compile stale call site |
| `AppShellScreen.LocalTabContent` | Calls `DesignSettingsScreen` with only design state/callback and modifier | Settings footer data must reach this call site | Medium — compile stale call site |
| `AppShellScreenTest` | Calls `AppShellScreen(rootComponent, appVersionName = "test")` | `AppShellScreen` signature changes need androidTest update | Medium — compile stale call site |
| `DrawerFooter` | Existing version text is clickable and tied to `onVersionTap` | Settings footer display-only must not reuse drawer tap behavior | Medium — behavior regression risk |

